# CineVault OS — root .dockerignore
# All three prod images (services/api/Dockerfile, services/ai_worker/Dockerfile,
# apps/web/Dockerfile) build with `context: ../..` (repo root) per
# infra/docker/docker-compose.prod.yml, and services/api/Dockerfile does a
# blanket `COPY . /app/`. Since services/api/config.py now actually loads the
# root .env at runtime (see WEB_FEATURE_AUDIT.md session 4), a developer
# building from a checkout with a real local .env would otherwise bake live
# secrets into the image and have them actively used. Never let real secrets
# cross into a build context.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Standard noise — not secrets, just build-context hygiene
.git
.gitignore
node_modules
**/node_modules
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.next
apps/web/.next
*.log
.wslconfig
